{"name":"Home Body","hex":"#f3d2b2","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"home body","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Alternative spelling of homebody."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/home_body"}],"entries":[{"title":"Home","blocks":[{"text":"A home, or domicile, is a space used as a permanent or semi-permanent residence for one or more human occupants, and sometimes various companion animals. Homes provide sheltered spaces, for instance rooms, where domestic activity can be performed such as sleeping, preparing food, eating, and hygiene as well as providing spaces for work and leisure such as remote working, studying, and playing."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c6/SearsHouse115.jpg/330px-SearsHouse115.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Home","wikidata":"Q7743"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b8/Taino_petroglyph_in_cave.jpg/500px-Taino_petroglyph_in_cave.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b8/Taino_petroglyph_in_cave.jpg/500px-Taino_petroglyph_in_cave.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Taíno petroglyphs in a cave in Puerto Rico","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ATaino_petroglyph_in_cave.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/Worker_home_from_1911_in_Helsinki.jpg/500px-Worker_home_from_1911_in_Helsinki.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/Worker_home_from_1911_in_Helsinki.jpg/1280px-Worker_home_from_1911_in_Helsinki.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/Worker_home_from_1911_